# Store every text file with LF in the repository and check it out as LF.
# This project's sources are authored with LF; Windows' default core.autocrlf
# would otherwise rewrite them to CRLF on checkout and churn the whole diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Genuinely binary assets must never be line-ending-normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
